# Event Component

Common interface for all monitoring events enabling uniform notification handling across Safe, Split, and Validator monitors.

## Key Integration Pattern
- All event types must implement the Event interface with consistent method signatures
- Support multiple description formats (text, markdown, HTML) for different notification channels

## Important Constraints
- Keep Event interface minimal - only essential display methods
- Event implementations should handle format-specific rendering internally
- Include boolean parameters for controlling monitor/group name display context